// Google Sign-In for iOS (task 02A.2). Included by Debug.xcconfig and
// Release.xcconfig (Profile uses Release.xcconfig).
//
// GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID_PREFIX is the iOS OAuth client ID of Google Cloud
// project broker-wallet (bundle com.nmodigital.brokerwallet) WITHOUT the
// ".apps.googleusercontent.com" suffix, for example 285578142613-abc123.
// It is a public identifier, not a secret; never put a client secret here.
//
// Info.plist builds both GIDClientID and the Google URL scheme from this one
// value, so they always match. Empty means no iOS client yet: keep the app's
// GOOGLE_SIGN_IN_IOS build flag off until it is filled in.
GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID_PREFIX =
